 "farming": {
  "about": "FARMING (#154, doc/land-civilisation.md; operator 2026-11-09: \"farmland, farming, soil types, etc\"). A hoe tills grass or earth with open air over it into farmland (not stony ground); a seed sown on farmland grows into ripe wheat in crop_s x its soil's time x moist when water lies within moist_reach columns at or below the field, and a harvest of it gives its soil's grain and seeds (wild grain gives 1 and 1). Read by the page (what the hoe says) and the world server (the rule).",
