  "about": "EATING (#155, doc/land-civilisation.md): food is a reward, never a meter that punishes a player who stops playing. Eating one item of food makes work quicker (breaking takes `work` of its time) for its seconds, added to what is left up to max_s. Read by the page (its break bar) and the world server (its work bucket).",
